Third-party names and artwork

App logos (PlayStation, Netflix, Disney+, Prime Video, YouTube, Spotify, Instagram) are
trademarks of their owners. They are not included in this repository; `npm run logos` downloads
them from Wikimedia Commons to your own machine, only to label the apps you launch.
launcher/art.js contains simplified drawn marks, shown only when a logo file is missing; they
identify the apps they launch and imply no endorsement.

Wallpapers are not included. The demo uses the 1984 Macintosh wallpapers captured by
Basic Apple Guy (https://basicappleguy.com), based on Apple's macOS artwork.

docs/demo.png and docs/demo.mp4 show this launcher and Samsung's stock home screen for
illustration.

This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Samsung, Apple, or any app shown.
